==Miscellaneous==
*Added [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]] feature.
*Added [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] feature.
*Reduced [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s base health from 2,000 to 1,500, and increased base recharge from 3,000f<sup>100s</sup> to 4,800f<sup>160s</sup>.
*Added 4 new Traits:
**[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] (属性を持たない敵, ''Zokusei o Motanai Teki'')
***Updated [[Doge]], [[Snache]], [[Those Guys]], [[Hippoe]], [[Jackie Peng]], [[Gory]], [[Baa Baa]], [[Le'boin]], [[Kang Roo]], [[Teacher Bear]], [[Croco]], [[Squire Rel]], [[The Face]], Unused Enemy 020, [[Ms. Sign]], [[Mooth]], [[Teacher Bun Bun]], [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)]], [[Li'l Gau (form 1) (Enemy)]], [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)]], [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)]], [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)]] and [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)]] to be Traitless.
**[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] (黒い敵, ''Kuroi Teki'')
***Updated [[Assassin Bear]] to be Dark.
**[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] (浮いてる敵, ''Uiteru Teki'')
***Updated [[Shy Boy]], [[The Face]], [[Mooth]] and [[Teacher Bun Bun]] to be Floating.
**[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] (メタルな敵, ''Metaruna Teki'')
*Added 8 new Abilities:
**'''[[Massive Damage]]''' (超ダメージ): Cats with this ability will deal 3x damage to their target traits. [[Fruit Treasures]] increase the damage to 4x.
**'''[[Resistant]]''' (打たれ強い): Cats with this ability take 1/4th damage from their target traits. Fruit Treasures reduce the damage taken to 1/5th.
**'''[[Knockback]]''' (ふっとばす): Units with this ability push foes backward by 165 units in 11 frames. Fruit Treasures increase the distance by 30% to 214.5 units.
**'''[[Freeze]]''' (動きを止める): Units with this ability freeze foes in place, stopping all movement and pausing animations for a set amount of time. Fruit Treasures increase duration for Cats by 20%.
**'''[[Slow]]''' (動きを遅くする): Units with this ability slow foes down to 0.5 speed for a set amount of time. Fruit Treasures increase duration for Cats by 20%.
**'''[[Critical]]''' (クリティカル): Units with this ability have a set % chance to deal a Critical Hit, dealing 2x damage and ignoring Metal.
**'''[[Money Up]]''' (撃破時お金アップ): Cats with this ability receive 2x the cash when defeating an enemy.
**'''[[Wave Attack]]''' (波動, ''Hadō''): Units with this ability have a set chance to a Wave Attack when landing a hit. Each level of the Wave Attack extends the range.
*[[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]], [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)|Zombie Cat]] lose [[Special Abilities|Strong Against]].

